  - m_Id: 6012385281142784
    m_Localized: Camera
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6012732066197504
    m_Localized: 'Right click to remove or store it.

      Left click to take a
      photo.

      The photographs show the original state without any anomaly.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6014548388573184
    m_Localized: Report
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6014905881686016
    m_Localized: 'To take out or put in the report, press Q.

      Enter the number
      of anomalies present here.

      Confirm your selection by signing. You can
      do this by clicking in the signature field or pressing Enter.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6017604819841024
    m_Localized: Camera
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6019807181762560
    m_Localized: 'Right click to remove or store it.

      Left click to take a
      photo.

      The photographs show the original state without any anomaly.

      To
      change mode, scroll with the mouse wheel.

      Ultraviolet light allows you
      to see anomalies invisible to the human eye without the need to take photos.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6021652272869376
    m_Localized: Flash Upgrade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6023548526096384
    m_Localized: 'Right click to remove or store it.

      Left click to take a
      photo.

      To change mode, scroll with the mouse wheel.

      By taking
      a photo of the enemy in this mode you make it temporarily fade away.

      These
      photos do not waste reels.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
